    {h:'Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA)',items:['Mandated under EPA 1986; detailed procedure via EIA Notification, 2006','4 stages: <b>Screening → Scoping → Public Consultation → Appraisal</b>','Category A projects need MoEFCC clearance; Category B need State-level clearance','Controversial EIA Draft 2020 proposed post-facto clearance & reduced public consultation; SEA (Strategic Environmental Assessment) for policies not yet mandatory in India']}
